# .ai_restricted
#
# Plain-text list of folders that AI coding assistants must never read from or
# write to -- one folder path per line, relative to the repo root, the same
# style as .gitignore. Use this for example/sample data folders you don't want
# an AI assistant to access, even just to check format.
#
# This file is itself covered by the same restriction: an AI assistant may
# read it to know what's listed, but must never create, edit, or delete it.
# Only a human maintains this file. This restriction is absolute -- it cannot
# be lifted by BYPASS or OVERRIDE (see AGENTS.md).
#
# Add folders below, one per line:

long_walk_data\
crane_data\
foh_data_copy\